.el .ds Aq '
.TH backup 1  "backup " 
.SH NAME
backup \- Back up databases, configuration, identity, and optionally blobs
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbackup\fR [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-include\-blobs\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Back up databases, configuration, identity, and optionally blobs
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR [default: .]

.TP
\fB\-\-include\-blobs\fR
Also copy the blob store (can be very large); off by default
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
